@startuml insight-x-sequence-run
' 创建任务并执行分析（与 sequence-analysis-run.mermaid 对应）
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
title Insight-X — 典型调用：创建任务并运行分析

actor "客户端\nHTTP/API Client" as C
participant "REST 入口\nFastAPI" as API
database "任务与结果缓存\nstore" as Mem
participant "流水线编排\nAnalysisOrchestrator" as Orch
participant "数据理解 Agent①\nDataUnderstandingAgent" as A1
participant "策略设计 Agent②\nAnalysisStrategyAgent" as A2
participant "代码生成 Agent③\nCodeGenerationAgent" as A3
participant "执行分析 Agent④\nCodeExecutionAgent" as A4
participant "洞察生成 Agent⑤\nInsightGenerationAgent" as A5
participant "异步数据库访问\nDatabaseConnector" as DB
participant "大模型统一封装\nLLMClient" as LLM
participant "沙箱执行\nSandboxExecutor" as SB

C -> API : POST /api/v1/tasks
API -> Mem : 保存 AnalysisTask (PENDING)
API --> C : task_id

C -> API : POST /api/v1/tasks/{id}/run
API -> Mem : mark_running()
API -> Orch : run_analysis(task)

Orch -> A1 : execute_with_context(...)
A1 -> DB : schema / 表名 / 抽样
DB --> A1 : 元数据与样本
A1 -> LLM : 数据理解 Prompt
LLM --> A1 : JSON 数据字典
A1 --> Orch : DataDictionary

Orch -> A2 : execute(strategy input)
A2 -> LLM : 策略 Prompt
LLM --> A2 : 分析计划 JSON
A2 --> Orch : strategy

Orch -> A3 : execute(code gen input)
A3 -> LLM : 代码生成 Prompt
LLM --> A3 : Python 源码
A3 --> Orch : generated_code

Orch -> A4 : execute(代码 + db_config)
A4 -> SB : execute(...线程池包装)
SB --> A4 : ExecutionResult
A4 --> Orch : ExecutionResult

note over Orch, A5
执行失败仍进入洞察，
stats 可为空 {}
end note

Orch -> A5 : execute(data_dict + stats)
A5 -> LLM : 洞察 Prompt
LLM --> A5 : Insight 列表
A5 --> Orch : insights

Orch --> API : AnalysisResult
API -> Mem : 写入结果 COMPLETED
API --> C : AnalysisResultResponse

@enduml
